Package: audioknob-gui
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: audioknob-gui contributors <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/chrisoctane/audioknob-gui
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyside6, policykit-1 | polkitd, pkexec | policykit-1, desktop-file-utils
Description: GUI-first realtime audio tuning app (transactions + preview/apply/undo)
 audioknob-gui applies system tuning knobs with transaction-based apply/undo/reset.
 Privileged changes run through pkexec/polkit using a fixed-path root worker.
